ram  [Music]  that's good  ever since she joined in 2017 fans have  been falling in love with every sweet  and often candid look inside the  actress's home sometimes I do something  called pretend cooking show on my on  Instagram modern comfort food  everything in here is  exactly what you want to be cooked cook  exactly what you want to be eating right  now  right now sorry I'm supposed to be  talking to you but I can't crispy  chicken with lemon orzo basically this  is what I want to have for lunch so this  is what I'm gonna make  from home cooking shows to singing in  the car to throwing herself her own  wedding we hope Jen keeps making it nice  on and offline  [Music]
 

